# DUSKLING X1, MOSSY BURROW (room 37): the mossy burrow, a warp pocket that skips the rest of the wood.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder.
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 37
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 27
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 7
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 20
wait 2
expect room == 7
